  "worked_solution": "To find every subset of $T,$ we list out every combination of elements within $T.$ \n\nWe can use the following diagram to visualize the process:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14038640/assets/127ee1187ebf3a2cc498c88326285d5adf5d609cf3276885e8c9d525435133eb.png)\n\nNote that we must include the empty set since it is a subset of every set.\n\nBy doing this, we get\n\n$$\n\u2205,\\,{1},\\,{2},\\,{3},\\,{1,2},\\,{1,3},\\,{2,3},\\,{1,2,3}.\n$$",
